# Advanced Data Structures and Algorithms (ADSA)

This repository contains the laboratory assignments, implementations, and solutions for the **Advanced Data Structures and Algorithms (ADSA)** course as part of the **M.Tech in Data Science and Engineering (DSE)** program at **National Institute of Technology, Jamshedpur**.

